nteric hernia: report of a case</article-title><source>Surg Today</source><year>2000</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>548</fpage><lpage>550</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10883470</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s005950070126</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sasaki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Sakai</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukumori</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Sato</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ohmori</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamamoto</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Transmesosigmoid hernia: report of a case</article-title><source>Surg Today</source><year>2002</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>1096</fpage><lpage>1098</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12541031</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s005950200222</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mieren</surname><given-names>G Van der</given-names></name><name><surname>de Gheldere</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Vanclooster</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Transmesosigmoid hernia: Report of a case and review of the literature</article-title><source>Acta Chir Belg</source><year>2005</year><volume>105</volume><fpage>653</fpage><lpage>655</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16438079</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yu</surname><given-names>CY</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Yu</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>CH</given-names></name><name><surname>Shyu</surname><given-names>RY</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>CY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Strangulated transmesosigmoid hernia: CT diagnosis</article-title><source>Abdom Imaging</source><year>2004</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>158</fpage><lpage>160</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15290938</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00261-003-0095-x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Blachar</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Federle</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Dodson</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Internal hernia: clinical and imaging findings in 17 patients with emphasis on CT criteria</article-title><source>Radiology</source><year>2001</year><volume>218</volume><fpage>68</fpage><lpage>74</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11152781</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Garza</surname><given-names>E</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Kuhn</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Arnold</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Nicholson</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Reddy</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>McCarty</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Internal hernias after laparoscopic Roux-en-Y gastric bypass</article-title><source>Am J Surg</source><year>2004</year><volume>188</volume><fpage>796</fpage><lpage>800</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15619502</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.amjsurg.2004.08.049</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>